        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to traditional health and welfare benefits, we also offer employees benefits such as paid parental leave, adoption assistance, health advocacy services, volunteer time off, tuition reimbursement, mental health support, fertility treatment, family planning services and many others.",
