        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe participants in our referral network refer potential clients to us because of the strength of our products and services, the value we provide our referral partners through our broker portal, the fact that we do not provide services that compete with our referral networks and because we offer third parties the ability to integrate their systems with our platform.",
